('advanced-native-1335', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1335-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The host dismisses questions, while the volunteer invites preferences before a decision."],"options":["The volunteer confirms that residents have chosen not to express any views.","The host dismisses questions, while the volunteer invites preferences before a decision.","Both refuse to hear preferences until the seating plan is final.","The host has already accepted every proposed seat change."]},"advanced-native-1335-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They were being spoken to as if their opinions no longer count, and the volunteer wanted their views heard before a decision.","Their questions had been dismissed rather than considered in the seating discussion.","There was still time to hear what mattered to them before finalising the plan.","Asking gave them a chance to participate instead of having their preferences assumed for them."],"options":["They were being spoken to as if their opinions no longer count, and the volunteer wanted their views heard before a decision.","Their questions had been dismissed rather than considered in the seating discussion.","There was still time to hear what mattered to them before finalising the plan.","Asking gave them a chance to participate instead of having their preferences assumed for them."]},"advanced-native-1335-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Being spoken to as if his opinions no longer count describes the dismissive treatment, not proof that his knowledge has no value."],"options":["The description establishes that the writer has assessed the technical advice and found it worthless.","The account says everyone listened to the complete proposal before giving a technical response.","Being spoken to as if his opinions no longer count describes the dismissive treatment, not proof that his knowledge has no value."]},"advanced-native-1335-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["先聽並考慮意見，之後仍可能有具體理由不採納。"],"options":["只要願意聆聽，就必須保證每項提議都會實行。","只要沒有採納，就證明從未聆聽。","先聽並考慮意見，之後仍可能有具體理由不採納。"]},"advanced-native-1335-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They should not be spoken to as if their opinions no longer count, but listening can lead to a discussion of conflicting requests rather than a promise to accept them all."],"options":["They should not be spoken to as if their opinions no longer count, but listening can lead to a discussion of conflicting requests rather than a promise to accept them all.","I would promise every requested seat first and discuss the conflicts only after the plan is published.","The conflicting requests give us a reason to stop asking residents what they prefer."]},"advanced-native-1335-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I do not want to be spoken to as if my opinions no longer count because I cannot attend. Please send the photographs tonight so I can comment before we finalise the selection, even if we need to discuss differences.","Please do not let me be spoken to as if my opinions no longer count in a project we share. I can review the photographs tonight; let us consider my comments before deciding, without assuming that either of us must accept every suggestion."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1336', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1336-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She listened calmly and checked the practical booking information before promising a place."],"options":["She listened calmly and checked the practical booking information before promising a place.","She offered every newcomer a place before checking whether any bookings matched.","She checked the list but refused to hear why the newcomers were worried.","She treated a worried question as a confirmed cancellation."]},"advanced-native-1336-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The role combined a considerate conversation with dependable handling of the list.","It needed a soft touch and a steady pair of hands to hear worries while checking bookings accurately.","Newcomers needed to be heard, and their places still required a careful check.","Calm reassurance alone could not establish which bookings were confirmed."],"options":["The role combined a considerate conversation with dependable handling of the list.","It needed a soft touch and a steady pair of hands to hear worries while checking bookings accurately.","Newcomers needed to be heard, and their places still required a careful check.","Calm reassurance alone could not establish which bookings were confirmed."]},"advanced-native-1336-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Here, a soft touch describes someone easily persuaded; it does not establish a soft touch and a steady pair of hands in the task-focused sense."],"options":["The loans establish that he has already checked every borrower’s arrangements carefully.","The passage explicitly praises his reliable handling of practical responsibilities.","Here, a soft touch describes someone easily persuaded; it does not establish a soft touch and a steady pair of hands in the task-focused sense."]},"advanced-native-1336-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["這個人已核對這項工作的每個實際細節。"],"options":["有人重視溫柔的方式及可靠的處理。","這個人已核對這項工作的每個實際細節。","實際行動可以說明兩項特質怎樣配合。"]},"advanced-native-1336-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We need a soft touch and a steady pair of hands: we can listen kindly while explaining that a place must be checked before it is promised."],"options":["We need a soft touch and a steady pair of hands: we can listen kindly while explaining that a place must be checked before it is promised.","I would promise a place to reassure each person and use the list only to decide who should leave later.","We should check the list without discussing their worries, so that they understand places are limited."]},"advanced-native-1336-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["She brings a soft touch and a steady pair of hands, explaining the route patiently and checking that each group is complete. I recommend asking her about the morning role, without assuming she can stay all day.","The visit would benefit from a soft touch and a steady pair of hands, and her patient directions and careful headcounts show both. Please confirm the morning arrangement with her before putting her on the rota."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1338', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1338-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Temporary entrances and conflicting directions make a shared current route especially important."],"options":["Visitors have agreed that different routes at the two doors are easier to follow.","The team has decided to leave yesterday’s information unchanged until every visit is over.","Temporary entrances and conflicting directions make a shared current route especially important.","The building has returned to its single permanent entrance and removed all temporary directions."]},"advanced-native-1338-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Visitors need the same current route at whichever temporary door they use.","The change in access makes an outdated instruction more likely to send someone the wrong way.","Checking daily addresses the confusion created by different information at the doors.","They matter more than ever because the temporary entrances have already led to conflicting directions."],"options":["Visitors need the same current route at whichever temporary door they use.","The change in access makes an outdated instruction more likely to send someone the wrong way.","Checking daily addresses the confusion created by different information at the doors.","They matter more than ever because the temporary entrances have already led to conflicting directions."]},"advanced-native-1338-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The map may be important, but the account has not explained why it matters more than ever this year."],"options":["The unchanged arrangements establish that the map was unnecessary last year.","The account identifies a new entrance as the reason for the stronger need.","The map may be important, but the account has not explained why it matters more than ever this year."]},"advanced-native-1338-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["以前的聆聽完全沒有價值，而且現在只需要聆聽。"],"options":["可以詢問目前甚麼改變令需要增加。","說話者強調，細心聆聽目前尤其重要。","以前的聆聽完全沒有價值，而且現在只需要聆聽。"]},"advanced-native-1338-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Accurate updates matter more than ever, so we should keep the daily check rather than assume today’s route will last ten days."],"options":["I would treat printing more copies as enough evidence that the directions remain current.","I would rely on the first printed version until the next scheduled event, rather than check each morning.","Accurate updates matter more than ever, so we should keep the daily check rather than assume today’s route will last ten days."]},"advanced-native-1338-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Checking our understanding matters more than ever when our guest is unfamiliar with the school’s shorthand. Let us keep time for questions instead of trying to sound fluent by rushing past unclear words.","Listening matters more than ever in our first interview with a guest from elsewhere, so we should allow a pause to check what each person means. A quick delivery is not worth losing a shared understanding."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1340', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1340-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Through shared attention and cooking, without making ownership the defining condition."],"options":["Through proof that the family has bought the flat and no longer pays rent.","Through a rule that each person must spend the evening alone.","Through a decision that the physical flat no longer matters for daily living.","Through shared attention and cooking, without making ownership the defining condition."]},"advanced-native-1340-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Cooking together shows the part of home I wanted to describe beyond the walls.","Our rented flat can matter emotionally without becoming something we own.","Home is not just a place to me; shared attention is part of what makes it meaningful.","The example explains a relationship rather than a property arrangement."],"options":["Cooking together shows the part of home I wanted to describe beyond the walls.","Our rented flat can matter emotionally without becoming something we own.","Home is not just a place to me; shared attention is part of what makes it meaningful.","The example explains a relationship rather than a property arrangement."]},"advanced-native-1340-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Saying home is not just a place does not establish that this particular person feels emotionally safe in her current house."],"options":["Saying home is not just a place does not establish that this particular person feels emotionally safe in her current house.","The phrase establishes that she has described her current house as welcoming.","The account says she has already moved into the friend’s home permanently."]},"advanced-native-1340-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["在地點以外，再加入其他意義。"],"options":["在地點以外，再加入其他意義。","否定家有任何實際位置。","保證所有人對家的經歷完全一樣。"]},"advanced-native-1340-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Home is not just a place, and respecting when each of us needs quiet can be part of the care we build here."],"options":["I would treat asking for quiet as proof that someone does not value the relationship.","We should leave each other’s needs unspoken so that the room feels more welcoming.","Home is not just a place, and respecting when each of us needs quiet can be part of the care we build here."]},"advanced-native-1340-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Home is not just a place, and the welcome we built in this room belongs in our thanks today. As we move, let us ask what each person would like to carry into the new gathering space, without expecting it to feel familiar at once.","For many of us, home is not just a place but the attention we give one another here. Thank you for those shared years; I hope we can shape the next room together while allowing time for different feelings about leaving this one."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1342', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1342-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The meeting idea has an inclusion problem to investigate, rather than already being abandoned."],"options":["The team has rejected any further contribution from members who cannot attend.","The meeting idea has an inclusion problem to investigate, rather than already being abandoned.","All evening workers have already confirmed they can attend the single meeting.","The written discussion has been completed and the final decision published."]},"advanced-native-1342-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["One meeting may sound ideal in theory but exclude people whose evening work prevents attendance.","We need a way for the evening workers to contribute before the decision.","A single meeting time might not give the whole membership an opportunity to respond.","The additional format could address a practical limit without discarding the meeting idea immediately."],"options":["One meeting may sound ideal in theory but exclude people whose evening work prevents attendance.","We need a way for the evening workers to contribute before the decision.","A single meeting time might not give the whole membership an opportunity to respond.","The additional format could address a practical limit without discarding the meeting idea immediately."]},"advanced-native-1342-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may sound ideal in theory but remains untested in that setting; the sentence does not report an actual failure."],"options":["The sentence reports a completed busy-shift trial with a failed result.","The sentence confirms that the system has worked successfully under peak demand.","It may sound ideal in theory but remains untested in that setting; the sentence does not report an actual failure."]},"advanced-native-1342-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The plan may sound ideal in theory but it requires two rooms we do not have."],"options":["The plan may sound ideal in theory