('advanced-native-1343', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1343-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Different attendants cover continuous shifts and hand over between them."],"options":["The displays will be left without supervision every night.","Supervision ends at each handover and restarts the following morning.","Different attendants cover continuous shifts and hand over between them.","One attendant has agreed to remain awake for the entire weekend."]},"advanced-native-1343-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The attendants share the hours instead of one person covering them all.","Each change includes a handover so the next attendant can take over.","The arrangement concerns continuous coverage, not keeping every attendant awake throughout.","It will provide round-the-clock supervision through different shifts and clear handovers."],"options":["The attendants share the hours instead of one person covering them all.","Each change includes a handover so the next attendant can take over.","The arrangement concerns continuous coverage, not keeping every attendant awake throughout.","It will provide round-the-clock supervision through different shifts and clear handovers."]},"advanced-native-1343-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The current rota does not yet provide round-the-clock supervision, because the night hours remain uncovered."],"options":["Listing daytime attendants establishes that the overnight shifts have also been accepted.","The account says the exhibition is removed every evening, so no night arrangement is intended.","The current rota does not yet provide round-the-clock supervision, because the night hours remain uncovered."]},"advanced-native-1343-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["監督覆蓋日間及夜間。"],"options":["監督覆蓋日間及夜間。","只有一位指定人士能做這項工作。","所有工作都已完成，不再需要交接。"]},"advanced-native-1343-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Round-the-clock supervision needs agreed coverage; we should ask who can take the night shifts before putting names on the rota."],"options":["I assumed the volunteer handling the evening handover would also cover the night, without asking about that shift.","Round-the-clock supervision needs agreed coverage; we should ask who can take the night shifts before putting names on the rota.","I would treat the coverage label as agreement from the classmates who have not replied."]},"advanced-native-1343-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for arranging round-the-clock supervision; I would like to join the model exhibition. Before I confirm, could you tell me who will receive my display on Friday and who will handle its return on Sunday?","I am interested in the exhibition with round-the-clock supervision, but I still need the handover details for my model. Who should I meet when I bring it on Friday and collect it on Sunday?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1344', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1344-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It enabled timely submission, while preparing the portfolio remained the speaker’s work."],"options":["A library tutor revised the portfolio before submitting it for the speaker.","It extended the application deadline after the speaker missed it.","It replaced the application with a promise to repair the laptop.","It enabled timely submission, while preparing the portfolio remained the speaker’s work."]},"advanced-native-1344-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The evening access made timely submission possible without doing the creative work for me.","It addressed the equipment problem at the point when I needed to send my work.","It was a real lifeline because it let me submit despite the broken laptop.","I had a deadline and needed a working way to send the portfolio."],"options":["The evening access made timely submission possible without doing the creative work for me.","It addressed the equipment problem at the point when I needed to send my work.","It was a real lifeline because it let me submit despite the broken laptop.","I had a deadline and needed a working way to send the portfolio."]},"advanced-native-1344-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The lamp may be useful, but the account does not establish that it was a real lifeline restoring his ability to work."],"options":["The account says the new lamp restored his ability to work after a complete lighting failure.","Calling the lamp convenient establishes that his earlier lighting had prevented him from working.","The lamp may be useful, but the account does not establish that it was a real lifeline restoring his ability to work."]},"advanced-native-1344-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["服務已答應繼續提供到下個學期。"],"options":["服務在某段困難中有重要幫助。","服務已答應繼續提供到下個學期。","可以補充它幫人應付了甚麼限制。"]},"advanced-native-1344-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The computer access was a real lifeline for sending my work, but I should