('advanced-native-1345', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1345-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The bags were left at the entrance and the organiser was notified, but collection was still pending."],"options":["The bags were left at the entrance and the organiser was notified, but collection was still pending.","The organiser had already opened every bag and distributed its contents inside.","The volunteers took the supplies away without telling anyone they had arrived.","The supplies were carried directly to readers’ tables before the message was sent."]},"advanced-native-1345-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They completed the doorstep delivery and passed on the information needed for collection.","They were dropping things at the door and letting the organiser know the bags were waiting.","They left labelled bags by the entrance instead of taking them into the reading room.","The message told the organiser that collection was still needed."],"options":["They completed the doorstep delivery and passed on the information needed for collection.","They were dropping things at the door and letting the organiser know the bags were waiting.","They left labelled bags by the entrance instead of taking them into the reading room.","The message told the organiser that collection was still needed."]},"advanced-native-1345-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She dropped the bag accidentally and then carried it inside; this is not evidence of dropping things at the door as an arranged delivery."],"options":["She dropped the bag accidentally and then carried it inside; this is not evidence of dropping things at the door as an arranged delivery.","The bag remained outside for another person to collect after she left.","The passage describes a completed doorstep delivery followed by a collection message."]},"advanced-native-1345-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["收件人是否已領取並確認內容。"],"options":["可以詢問上下文所指的是哪個門口。","袋曾被送到或放在門口。","收件人是否已領取並確認內容。"]},"advanced-native-1345-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We dropped them at the door and sent a message, but we still need confirmation of collection before saying they were distributed."],"options":["We dropped them at the door and sent a message, but we still need confirmation of collection before saying they were distributed.","I would treat notification as confirmation that everyone has received their share.","We should describe the bags as never delivered because the organiser has not collected them yet."]},"advanced-native-1345-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Please drop the bags at the door of the rehearsal room, not the street entrance; I will be waiting inside the room. Send me a message when you arrive so I can collect the paper hats from you.","When you drop them at the door, please use the rehearsal-room door rather than the outside gate. I will wait in the room; could you message me on arrival before leaving the borrowed hats?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1347', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1347-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The loss of informal shared conversations, not a complete failure of the phone."],"options":["A complete loss of every communication channel, including messages.","A return to the same daily conversations in the reopened art room.","The loss of informal shared conversations, not a complete failure of the phone.","A decision to avoid the group because all contact was unwanted."]},"advanced-native-1347-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The messages did not fully replace talking together while we cleared the tables.","I missed a particular kind of company, not just the ability to send information.","A working device did not give me the informal interaction I had enjoyed in the room.","I felt cut off from others because I had lost the ordinary conversations around our shared work."],"options":["The messages did not fully replace talking together while we cleared the tables.","I missed a particular kind of company, not just the ability to send information.","A working device did not give me the informal interaction I had enjoyed in the room.","I felt cut off from others because I had lost the ordinary conversations around our shared work."]},"advanced-native-1347-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Choosing a quiet morning does not establish that she feels cut off from the world, especially given her stated enjoyment and later plans."],"options":["Choosing a quiet morning does not establish that she feels cut off from the world, especially given her stated enjoyment and later plans.","Sitting alone confirms that she has no way to contact the friends she plans to meet.","Her later meeting is described as a cancelled plan that leaves her disappointed."]},"advanced-native-1347-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["朋友已明確要求他不要再聯絡。"],"options":["朋友已明確要求他不要再聯絡。","上下文可以指出哪類接觸減少了。","他感到缺少想要的人際聯繫。"]},"advanced-native-1347-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I can feel cut off from others without losing the phone; I miss the informal company, not merely a way to send a message."],"options":["I would treat being able to send a message as proof that I do not miss any company.","I can feel cut off from others without losing the phone; I miss the informal company, not merely a way to send a message.","I thought simply increasing the number of messages could replace the missing conversations, without asking what kind of contact I missed."]},"advanced-native-1347-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I do not want you to feel cut off from others just because the evening meetups do not fit your time. Would a short lunch conversation or an occasional private message suit you, without sharing your family circumstances with the class?","You need not feel cut off from the world to keep your family plans private. If you would like, we could catch up briefly at lunch; please tell me whether that would be useful rather than feeling you have to join."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1348', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1348-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The claim circulated quickly, while confirmation was still missing."],"options":["The organiser had confirmed cancellation before any student heard the claim.","The groups decided that repeated reposts were enough to establish the new plan.","The students changed plans without checking the current notice.","The claim circulated quickly, while confirmation was still missing."]},"advanced-native-1348-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We needed the current arrangement before deciding what to do.","The organiser had not yet confirmed what the groups were passing around.","The rumour spread like wildfire, but its speed did not tell us whether the rehearsal was cancelled.","Many copies could still come from the same unconfirmed claim."],"options":["We needed the current arrangement before deciding what to do.","The organiser had not yet confirmed what the groups were passing around.","The rumour spread like wildfire, but its speed did not tell us whether the rehearsal was cancelled.","Many copies could still come from the same unconfirmed claim."]},"advanced-native-1348-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It could spread like wildfire if shared, but the account has not established any actual circulation yet."],"options":["The condition confirms that the draft has been publicly posted.","It could spread like wildfire if shared, but the account has not established any actual circulation yet.","The warning reports that students across the school have already received it."]},"advanced-native-1348-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["消息很快傳到越來越多人之間。"],"options":["消息很快傳到越來越多人之間。","每位收件人都已核實並相信消息。","消息已被證明完全虛假。"]},"advanced-native-1348-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It has spread like wildfire, but repeated sharing is not confirmation; let us check the current notice before changing plans."],"options":["It has spread like wildfire, but repeated sharing is not confirmation; let us check the current notice before changing plans.","I would count each copied message as an independent confirmation from the organiser.","We should describe it as proven false because the organiser has not replied yet."]},"advanced-native-1348-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Private speculation can spread like wildfire, so please do not repost the screenshot or ask her to explain herself publicly. If we need the current membership list, let us ask the organiser about the public arrangements instead.","Let us not help guesses spread like wildfire by sharing a private screenshot. We can check the club’s public membership arrangements without claiming to know her reasons or asking her to defend them in the group."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1349', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1349-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their earlier work was named and they were invited, without everyone’s attendance being guaranteed."],"options":["Their earlier work was named and they were invited, without everyone’s attendance being guaranteed.","Every former member had already confirmed a place in the anniversary programme.","The tutor had removed the earlier work to make room for current members only.","The invitation required everyone to resume regular membership."]},"advanced-native-1349-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The invitation acknowledged their contributions even when some could not attend.","It showed they had not been forgotten, since the tutor named their earlier contributions.","Their work remained part of the group’s remembered history.","They were included in the anniversary invitation rather than treated as having had no role."],"options":["The invitation acknowledged their contributions even when some could not attend.","It showed they had not been forgotten, since the tutor named their earlier contributions.","Their work remained part of the group’s remembered history.","They were included in the anniversary invitation rather than treated as having had no role."]},"advanced-native-1349-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["His name has not been forgotten in the record, but the account does not establish continuing personal care."],"options":["Keeping the name establishes that someone has been visiting him regularly.","The account explicitly reports a recent conversation about how he is managing.","His name has not been forgotten in the record, but the account does not establish continuing personal care."]},"advanced-native-1349-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["她已同意接受新的邀請。"],"options":["她已同意接受新的邀請。","上下文可以指出甚麼行動顯示記得。","仍有人記得她。"]},"advanced-native-1349-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They have not been forgotten, but remembering and inviting them does not confirm that they can perform."],"options":["I would use the invitation list as the confirmed running order before hearing back.","I would wait for performance replies before acknowledging their earlier contributions, as if the two decisions had to be linked.","They have not been forgotten, but remembering and inviting them does not confirm that they can perform."]},"advanced-native-1349-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Your early work on the oral accounts has not been forgotten, and it is still helping this exhibition. Would you like to be named in the acknowledgements, and how would you prefer us to describe your contribution?","The help you gave with those accounts has not been forgotten; I want to acknowledge it accurately rather than publish your name without asking. Could you tell me whether you would like a credit and what wording you would prefer?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
