-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We have set up the club, but we should invite students to try it rather than turn interest into a commitment they have not made."],"options":["We have set up the club, but we should invite students to try it rather than turn interest into a commitment they have not made.","I would treat asking about the club as agreement to attend every session.","We should cancel the first meeting until every student promises a whole term."]},"advanced-native-1350-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I would like to set up an oral-history group where interviewees can choose whether to be recorded. Could we discuss a lunchtime room and the consent arrangements with the teacher before inviting anyone?","Before we set up the oral-history group, let us ask about a room and agree how to explain the choice not to record an interview. Could we discuss these arrangements with the teacher before inviting participants?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1353', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1353-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They reduce avoidable confusion, while larger disagreements still require discussion."],"options":["The speaker says the small acts have replaced the need to discuss the disagreements.","They reduce avoidable confusion, while larger disagreements still require discussion.","The neighbours have agreed that all parcel and chair arrangements are now one person’s duty.","Borrowed chairs are kept until a larger disagreement has been resolved."]},"advanced-native-1353-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are the oil that keeps everyday life running smoothly by preventing unnecessary confusion between neighbours.","A quick notification or timely return can prevent a small misunderstanding from growing.","They make shared arrangements easier without claiming to settle every disagreement.","The image highlights how ordinary consideration can reduce friction in repeated interactions."],"options":["They are the oil that keeps everyday life running smoothly by preventing unnecessary confusion between neighbours.","A quick notification or timely return can prevent a small misunderstanding from growing.","They make shared arrangements easier without claiming to settle every disagreement.","The image highlights how ordinary consideration can reduce friction in repeated interactions."]},"advanced-native-1353-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This describes literal lubrication, not by itself the kindness metaphor of the oil that keeps everyday life running smoothly."],"options":["This describes literal lubrication, not by itself the kindness metaphor of the oil that keeps everyday life running smoothly.","The door remained stiff because the worker used no lubricant.","The worker replaced the hinge rather than lubricating the existing one."]},"advanced-native-1353-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["主人已答應每天替鄰居處理包裹。"],"options":["可以用具體互動說明甚麼變得較順。","小小體諒可以減少日常相處摩擦。","主人已答應每天替鄰