('advanced-native-1387', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1387-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Reduced participation and hesitation supported the speaker’s impression, without establishing everyone’s thoughts."],"options":["The speaker interviewed every participant before describing a shared reaction.","The two members stopped speaking because their scheduled presentations had already ended.","Reduced participation and hesitation supported the speaker’s impression, without establishing everyone’s thoughts.","Everyone openly agreed that the comment had improved the discussion."]},"advanced-native-1387-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The change in participation and the next speaker’s hesitation affected how the room felt to me.","I noticed less willingness to contribute after the remark.","The withdrawal and hesitation supported that impression, though they did not tell me what everyone was thinking.","The sarcastic comment made the room feel heavy as people withdrew from offering ideas."],"options":["The change in participation and the next speaker’s hesitation affected how the room felt to me.","I noticed less willingness to contribute after the remark.","The withdrawal and hesitation supported that impression, though they did not tell me what everyone was thinking.","The sarcastic comment made the room feel heavy as people withdrew from offering ideas."]},"advanced-native-1387-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Silence alone does not show that anything made the room feel heavy; the account describes attentive thinking and useful questions."],"options":["Silence alone does not show that anything made the room feel heavy; the account describes attentive thinking and useful questions.","The students’ silence is given as confirmation that they felt unable to contribute.","The account reports that no student asked a relevant question afterwards."]},"advanced-native-1387-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每位在場者已親口確認同一種感受。"],"options":["可以再問有哪些反應支持描述。","說話