('advanced-native-1388', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1388-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Ideas stopped developing together after the dismissal, but individual feelings were not checked."],"options":["Every participant confirmed feeling cheerful immediately after the comment.","The discussion became lively only after the ideas had been dismissed.","The speaker describes a planned silent writing period before sharing more suggestions.","Ideas stopped developing together after the dismissal, but individual feelings were not checked."]},"advanced-native-1388-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["People no longer added to one another’s contributions in the way they had before.","People had been building on the ideas and then stopped, suggesting lost energy rather than a report from every person.","The dismissal seemed to drain the air out of it as people stopped developing the suggestions together.","The earlier flow of ideas weakened after the remark."],"options":["People no longer added to one another’s contributions in the way they had before.","People had been building on the ideas and then stopped, suggesting lost energy rather than a report from every person.","The dismissal seemed to drain the air out of it as people stopped developing the suggestions together.","The earlier flow of ideas weakened after the remark."]},"advanced-native-1388-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The planned silence does not show that anything drained the air out of the discussion; the later exchange was active."],"options":["The account describes members losing interest and refusing to share their drawings.","The three quiet minutes replaced the planned comparison, which never happened.","The planned silence does not show that anything drained the air out of the discussion; the later exchange was active."]},"advanced-native-1388-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["發言者已承認，自己故意讓大家難過。"],"options":["需要知道it指甚麼活動或情境。","說話者感到那句話令活動失去活力。","發言者已承認，自己故意讓大家難過。"]},"advanced-native-1388-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The remark seemed to drain the air out of the discussion, but its effect does not establish what he intended."],"options":["The remark seemed to drain the air out of the discussion, but its effect does not establish what he intended.","I assumed a negative effect on the group was enough to confirm a deliberate attempt to hurt them.","I thought we had checked everyone’s feelings because we noticed fewer suggestions."]},"advanced-native-1388-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The brief reply seems to drain the air out of the dinner scene, as the narration moves from jokes to still chopsticks and unanswered remarks. Those details suggest a loss of energy without telling us what the uncle intended.","The writer lets one reply drain the air out of it: the lively dinner becomes a scene of paused eating and broken conversation. This is an effect created through the narrated details, not direct access to the uncle’s thoughts."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1389', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1389-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Repeated changes in interaction and two members’ accounts, with quieter members still to be heard."],"options":["Repeated changes in interaction and two members’ accounts, with quieter members still to be heard.","One photograph that establishes the feelings of everyone over the whole year.","A report that no member had asked a question during any meeting.","Confirmation that the quieter members had the same experience before anyone asked them."]},"advanced-native-1389-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The observed interactions and the newcomers’ accounts point in a similar direction.","The emotional climate became more accepting of mistakes across several meetings.","People could acknowledge an error without the mocking that would discourage questions.","Two newcomers described feeling more able to ask questions."],"options":["The observed interactions and the newcomers’ accounts point in a similar direction.","The emotional climate became more accepting of mistakes across several meetings.","People could acknowledge an error without the mocking that would discourage questions.","Two newcomers described feeling more able to ask questions."]},"advanced-native-1389-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A smiling photograph alone does not establish the emotional climate across a year of meetings."],"options":["A smiling photograph alone does not establish the emotional climate across a year of meetings.","The photograph documents how members responded to disagreement throughout the year.","The account includes each member’s explanation of how freely they can question a proposal."]},"advanced-native-1389-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每位成員已親口表示沒有任何擔心。"],"options":["每位成員已親口表示沒有任何擔心。","可以再問哪些互動及經驗支持描述。","某個群體的情緒氛圍被描述為改善。"]},"advanced-native-1389-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their accounts help us understand the emotional climate, but we should also invite the quieter members to describe what participation feels like for them."],"options":["I would use the number of questions alone, without asking whether people felt able to disagree.","Their accounts help us understand the emotional climate, but we should also invite the quieter members to describe what participation feels like for them.","I assumed two positive accounts were enough to establish the same experience for everyone."]},"advanced-native-1389-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The feedback suggests a mixed emotional climate: three members find break-time chats comfortable but hesitate to disagree during formal critiques, while two feel at ease there too. Next term, we propose a few minutes of written reflection before each critique.","Our report distinguishes the emotional climate of informal breaks from that of formal critiques, with three members reporting difficulty disagreeing and two describing comfort in both settings. We will try a short period for writing comments before next term’s critiques."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1392', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1392-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The narrator explicitly identifies the irritation Mara is hiding."],"options":["The narrator says Mara genuinely enjoys the compliment and feels no irritation.","Mara has explained her irritation openly to the person praising her.","The narrator explicitly identifies the irritation Mara is hiding.","Another character has confirmed her feelings from a photograph alone."]},"advanced-native-1392-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her shown expression does not match the feeling the narrator reveals.","We are told about concealed resentment, not merely shown a smiling face.","The description depends on access to her private response to the praise.","It is a plastic smile because the narrator says Mara is hiding irritation rather than enjoying the compliment."],"options":["Her shown expression does not match the feeling the narrator reveals.","We are told about concealed resentment, not merely shown a smiling face.","The description depends on access to her private response to the praise.","It is a plastic smile because the narrator says Mara is hiding irritation rather than enjoying the compliment."]},"advanced-native-1392-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The photograph alone does not establish a plastic smile or the motive the observer has assigned to it."],"options":["A stiff expression shows that nervousness cannot explain the smile.","The photograph alone does not establish a plastic smile or the motive the observer has assigned to it.","The image records the student admitting that he dislikes the teacher."]},"advanced-native-1392-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["那人心裏必定在厭惡眼前的人。"],"options":["那人心裏必定在厭惡眼前的人。","若要解釋感受，仍需要更多資料。","可以描述照片中可見的表情。"]},"advanced-native-1392-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The narrator calls it a plastic smile precisely because the outward expression hides the irritation we are told about."],"options":["I thought any smile established pleasure even when the narrator described a conflicting feeling.","I assumed the other character knew about her resentment too, because the narrator had revealed it to us.","The narrator calls it a plastic smile precisely because the outward expression hides the irritation we are told about."]},"advanced-native-1392-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could the character give a plastic smile during the congratulations, with the later monologue revealing the resentment beneath it? That contrast would belong to her role in the scene, not a judgement about you as the actor.","I suggest a plastic smile for the public congratulations, followed by a more direct expression of resentment in the monologue. Please make the contrast about the character’s two responses rather than your own attitude to the other performers."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1393', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1393-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The goal motivated the group, but attendance still needed individual confirmation."],"options":["The group lost interest because the goal gave no practical reason to help.","The goal motivated the group, but attendance still needed individual confirmation.","Everyone had already agreed to attend every weekend before the talk.","The organiser regarded wanting to help as sufficient confirmation of attendance."]},"advanced-native-1393-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The clear goal fired us up by showing how our mapping could improve the path.","We could see a practical use for the difficult sections we would record.","The proposal connected our work with making the route easier for people to use.","A specific improvement gave us a reason to want to contribute."],"options":["The clear goal fired us up by showing how our mapping could improve the path.","We could see a practical use for the difficult sections we would record.","The proposal connected our work with making the route easier for people to use.","A specific improvement gave us a reason to want to contribute."]},"advanced-native-1393-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The film may fire them up, but enthusiasm alone does not establish the practical skill the activity requires."],"options":["The account confirms that the students have completed the activity’s practical training.","Their excitement shows that they no longer need to ask how the activity is done.","The film may fire them up, but enthusiasm alone does not establish the practical skill the activity requires."]},"advanced-native-1393-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每個人都已答應一項具體輪值。"],"options":["可以再問演講用甚麼目標激發他們。","演講讓他們產生興奮或行動意欲。","每個人都已答應一項具體輪值。"]},"advanced-native-1393-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The goal fired us up, but we should ask who can attend on Saturday before treating the enthusiasm as a confirmed rota."],"options":["I assumed the successful first trial meant we could assign the practical tasks without asking what each person had done before.","The goal fired us up, but we should ask who can attend on Saturday before treating the enthusiasm as a confirmed rota.","I thought wanting to help meant every person had already checked Saturday against their other plans."]},"advanced-native-1393-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A short scene we each care about could fire us up more than another page of copied notes. Could everyone choose a passage to read aloud, then tell us which question about the drama they want to explore?","Let us try to fire up the group by hearing a few scenes people have chosen, rather than assume more copying will restore our interest. After the readings, I would like to ask what you want to investigate next."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1394', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1394-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The visitor formed an impression from the arrival, and the speaker then explained its cause and offered help."],"options":["The visitor formed an impression from the arrival, and the speaker then explained its cause and offered help.","The visitor had heard a refusal to help before noticing the expression.","The speaker confirmed that the visitor herself had caused the annoyance.","The account says nobody noticed the rushed arrival until after the full explanation."]},"advanced-native-1394-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["My first appearance did not tell her what had actually happened on the journey.","The energy we carry often speaks before we do, and my rushed arrival had created an impression I wanted to clarify.","I wanted to distinguish my travel frustration from my willingness to help her.","She had noticed my expression, so an explanation could give context she did not yet have."],"options":["My first appearance did not tell her what had actually happened on the journey.","The energy we carry often speaks before we do, and my rushed arrival had created an impression I wanted to clarify.","I wanted to distinguish my travel frustration from my willingness to help her.","She had noticed my expression, so an explanation could give context she did not yet have."]},"advanced-native-1394-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The energy we carry can suggest an impression before we speak, but the observer still needs to ask what her expression means here."],"options":["The account includes her explanation that the visitors are unwelcome.","The energy we carry can suggest an impression before we speak, but the observer still needs to ask what her expression means here.","The serious expression records her explicit decision not to welcome anyone."]},"advanced-native-1394-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每位觀察者都會準確理解對方內心。"],"options":["每位觀察者都會準確理解對方內心。","仍可用談話澄清狀態及意思。","可見表現可能影響第一印象。"]},"advanced-native-1394-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The energy we carry often speaks before we do, but I can explain the missed bus rather than let an impression stand as my intention."],"options":["I thought her first impression already established what had caused my expression.","I assumed my hurried arrival had already communicated that I wanted to help quickly, so I did not need to offer help in words.","The energy we carry often speaks before we do, but I can explain the missed bus rather than let an impression stand as my intention."]},"advanced-native-1394-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The energy we carry often speaks before we do, so let us put the cameras away and greet our hosts before asking to record anything. A short pause will give us room to explain the visit and hear what they are comfortable sharing.","Since the energy we carry often speaks before we do, I suggest arriving with the cameras packed rather than already taking photographs. We can begin with a greeting, explain our purpose and ask what recording, if any, the hosts would welcome."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1395', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1395-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It recorded time for several tasks, not the fit or quality of the costumes."],"options":["It counted only the time actors spent wearing the finished costumes.","The twenty-hour total establishes that every costume fitted equally well.","The team had not recorded any preparation or clearing time.","It recorded time for several tasks, not the fit or quality of the costumes."]},"advanced-native-1395-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gives a total contribution of time without assessing the finished fit.","The record includes preparation and clearing rather than only visible rehearsal activity.","The hours put in cover measuring, stitching and clearing, with twenty hours recorded altogether.","Several kinds of work are included in the recorded time."],"options":["It gives a total contribution of time without assessing the finished fit.","The record includes preparation and clearing rather than only visible rehearsal activity.","The hours put in cover measuring, stitching and clearing, with twenty hours recorded altogether.","Several kinds of work are included in the recorded time."]},"advanced-native-1395-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The hours put in use different recording scopes, so equal totals alone do not establish equal amounts of the same work."],"options":["The hours put in use different recording scopes, so equal totals alone do not establish equal amounts of the same work.","The same number establishes that both records include identical tasks.","The account says both volunteers counted preparation and the interview in the same way."]},"advanced-native-1395-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每人的技巧及成品質素都已量度。"],"options":["每人的技巧及成品質素都已量度。","仍可問記錄涵蓋哪些活動。","有人記下投入活動的時間。"]},"advanced-native-1395-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The hours put in show recorded time, but we need different evidence before judging skill or quality."],"options":["I would compare the totals before asking whether preparation and clearing were counted in the same way.","The hours put in show recorded time, but we need different evidence before judging skill or quality.","I thought a longer recorded duration was enough to identify the most skilful person."]},"advanced-native-1395-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Before we plan next term, could you estimate the hours put in arranging the interviews and preparing the transcripts, as well as the recording time? A thirty-minute recording does not tell us how much preparation and follow-up the schedule needs to allow.","The hours put in are not fully described by the length of each recording, so I need your estimates for arranging visits and editing transcripts. Could you send those separately before we agree next term’s timetable?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1396', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1396-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Repeated rereading without deciding led the speaker to save the remaining choices for the next morning."],"options":["The account gives a permanent diagnosis about the speaker’s ability to read.","The speaker abandoned the whole publication rather than return to the choices later.","Repeated rereading without deciding led the speaker to save the remaining choices for the next morning.","The speaker completed all the choices without needing to revisit any paragraph."]},"advanced-native-1396-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I was mentally tired enough to revisit the same passage without reaching a decision.","A fresh look seemed more useful than continuing the unproductive rereading.","I was making no progress while tired, so I wanted to return after a pause rather than abandon the task.","The repeated decisions seemed to wear out my mind, and rereading was no longer helping me choose."],"options":["I was mentally tired enough to revisit the same passage without reaching a decision.","A fresh look seemed more useful than continuing the unproductive rereading.","I was making no progress while tired, so I wanted to return after a pause rather than abandon the task.","The repeated decisions seemed to wear out my mind, and rereading was no longer helping me choose."]},"advanced-native-1396-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A complex question can require effort without establishing that it has worn out the mind of this learner."],"options":["The account reports that he can no longer concentrate and wants to stop.","The account describes him spending many hours on repeated attempts before losing concentration.","A complex question can require effort without establishing that it has worn out the mind of this learner."]},"advanced-native-1396-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者已永久失去理解這類工作的能力。"],"options":["說話者已永久失去理解這類工作的能力。","可以再問哪些反覆思考造成負擔。","說話者把任務描述為令人心力疲憊。"]},"advanced-native-1396-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The repeated choices seemed to wear out my mind today, but a pause is part of finishing the task, not a decision to leave it."],"options":["I thought needing a break meant I had already lost all interest in the publication.","I assumed returning to the choices tomorrow meant postponing the publication deadline as well, rather than just pausing this evening’s review.","The repeated choices seemed to wear out my mind today, but a pause is part of finishing the task, not a decision to leave it."]},"advanced-native-1396-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Here, repeated choices appear to wear out the mind, as Lia rereads the same letter without choosing a reply. The next chapter shows her solving a new problem, so this scene presents temporary fatigue rather than her whole ability.","The novel shows how everyday decisions can wear out the mind for an evening without defining the character’s lasting ability. Lia’s clearer response to a new problem in the following chapter changes how we should read the earlier hesitation."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb)
